WEBVTT

00:00:59.746 --> 00:01:04.454
to you that the first thing you are is a
writer. Was that ever really in doubt?

00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:09.079
No, no. It was never in
doubt inside myself.

00:01:09.538 --> 00:01:13.954
But what I meant by that is one of
the things that happened after

00:01:13.954 --> 00:01:15.246
a while became a bestseller,

00:01:15.246 --> 00:01:20.038
is suddenly I had so many opportunities
that were not writing.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.538
They were writing adjacent.

00:01:21.871 --> 00:01:28.579
For example, I now have a really active
career as a as a paid public speaker.

00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:31.413
I never I mean, I do unpaid
public talks, too.